  "notes": "Six public transactions at six different payees and six distinct recipient accounts. Five outside UZP, including an incoming business-to-business transaction. Two mBank receipts share a layout. Earlier experiments covered retail mBank, Millennium, Pekao and CA24. The new development set uses ING and DNB. Documents are individual confirmations and public originals, not six complete cases.",
